    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/abudhraj/FastEEC/zipball/0.3",
    "body": "Provides a new implementation of N-point energy correlators that can used for any (integer or non-integer) N values. The new algorithm relies on a new parametrization of N-point projected energy correlators recently proposed and achieves a computational scaling of M^2 log(M), without approximations."
